id: BUILD-022
ilities: [modularity]
source: cpm
maturity: 2
action: advisory
title: Top-level import in .d.ts file breaks global declarations
category: build
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .d.ts
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
patterns:
  - regex: ^import\s+
    message: "Top-level import in .d.ts file — converts global ambient declarations into module scope, breaking type augmentation"
fix: Use import() type syntax instead — type X = import('./module').X — or wrap in declare global { }.
